      "side": 1,
      "message": "That works already. The problem is that tests rely on PATH but don\u0027t incorporate the machinery to read environment variables from soong.environment.available (or from anywhere else -- they just use whatever $PATH happens to be available, which can be many things depending on whether they are invoked from \"go test\", an IDE, or Soong\u0027s test battery.\n\nDoes xcrun have a well-known location one could hard-wire instead?",
      "parentUuid": "cec91f5d_ee3a60df",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 180,
