      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T10:55:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I see.\n\n\u003e Does xcrun have a well-known location one could hard-wire instead?\n\nThe default path would be /usr/bin/xcrun, so 99%+ of the time it\u0027ll be there, but I\u0027m not sure that should be relied upon 100%. (I also didn\u0027t check back on older Mac/xcode versions, but I don\u0027t think that\u0027s changed over the duration we support)",
      "parentUuid": "156e1f9a_409bfb8a",
